        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').first().json.message.chat.id }}",
        "text": "Set your TheatreMatch preferences\n\nCopy and complete this template, then send it back:\n\nGenre: Comedy\nMaximum price: 20\nPreferred area: 8th arrondissement\nPreferred period: Saturday, Sunday\n\nAvailable options\n\n- Genre: Comedy, Tragedy, Classic, Contemporary, Absurd Theatre, Musical, Drama, Any\n- Maximum price: Your budget in euros\n- Preferred area: A Paris arrondissement or Any\n- Preferred period: Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday. You can select multiple days, separated by commas, or choose Any.\n\nYour preferences will be saved for your daily recommendations!",
        "additionalFields": {}
